{"job_id":"F-b44c59e4fd88159da7ea","family_id":"F-b44c59e4fd88159da7ea","title":"평창 동계올림픽 및 동계패럴림픽 기장령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":21,"target_id":"a20821e618005e3e1a78b5b1538215e8dbd40480acb410ae85c1bb8c6a50cc58","source_hash":"51b8fe6b3f3b049cb7d17a19f9e8d879ea26ca2ee4a6e1d819197ca7a47d1a2a","text":"平昌冬奥会和冬残奥会 基江岭"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":136,"target_id":"a71d4399d11f45db5df1ab38663ddf9c263130816114edcd21759b36a8439e14","source_hash":"ebf59fe2d223787c745abee44994addb39bbcf7a763c665cf500af123899d165","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是规定向为成功举办和运营2018年平昌冬奥会和冬残奥会做出贡献的军人、警察、消防员和志愿者颁发平昌冬奥会和冬残奥会奖牌等必要事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"BODY","start":136,"end":482,"target_id":"c852207d1db82f75db0a2c6b59110f35f7b195a22567e26c7083e83302741771","source_hash":"cb481e7101dbc0e2aa327b38da5400752efb488683b96c4c807a398aae026c7a","text":"第二条（奖牌获得者等）平昌冬奥会暨残奥会奖牌（以下简称“奖牌”）应授予在与2018年平昌冬奥会暨残奥会直接相关的设施内，根据《2018年平昌冬奥会暨残奥会支援特别法》第二条第二款、2018年平昌冬奥会暨残奥会组委会或为2018年平昌冬奥会暨残奥会（以下简称“赛事”）安全举办所必需的其他场所，履行下列各款所列职责至少10天的军人、警察、消防员和志愿者。\n1. 活动安保和警卫职责\n2. 比赛期间的消防职责包括防火、救援和紧急医疗服务\n3. 负责比赛筹备和运营等方面的支持工作。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"BODY","start":482,"end":517,"target_id":"18565170a05cbca658119ca3f89bb18a9b800e5c41cae19c1dbcc9fdf5e29c1e","source_hash":"498b0b15aa92ae201c1455b8b7564dd80dcde685fb06467347699b0c9d41c3cc","text":"第三条（形式和格式）账簿的形式和格式如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"BODY","start":517,"end":618,"target_id":"9df12e1cbf8a287ad9cbfb7d89f214ffad6566e72c05975c785adcd08ded123c","source_hash":"092c3acae9e2c38eca5bc6f94c33e0566ea04ce50ff72b5862f1ec72d4a78d9d","text":"第四条（授予等的权限）\n① 该奖章由文化、体育和观光部长颁发。\n② 文化体育观光部长官应将平昌冬奥会暨冬残奥会奖牌证书（格式见附件）连同奖牌一并颁发给奖牌获得者。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"BODY","start":618,"end":653,"target_id":"1bc0d79ae428e159aa10b29759c5e7c72505786d5ef355bf0d75cec3eaa1962c","source_hash":"ce42009dd37e99e1d62d5d889a386457e12abbd0aafe61fc1f7905219b109573","text":"第五条（佩戴徽章）只有获得徽章的人才能佩戴。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"BODY","start":653,"end":2406,"target_id":"364bc82e16ee312f306399651a12d6e0d2fc6c57dde7ff21ba748c39800ea12c","source_hash":"581a68d26ef559328882426a6afa527900a9015f9edc245b9e075c27bfdfa9b4","text":"补充规定 <第29941号，2019年7月2日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n平昌冬奥会和冬残奥会会徽的形式和样式（与第3条相关）\n■ 平昌冬奥会和冬残奥会旗帜条例 [附件]                  \n\n  平昌冬奥会和冬残奥会会徽的形式和样式（与第3条相关）   \n\n  1. 长度类型                                                    \n\n  2. 小米形式                                                    \n\n┌────────┬────┬────┬──┬──────────┐\n\n│分类 │尺寸（毫米）│颜色 │材质 │备注 │\n\n├──┬─────┼────┼────┼──┼──────────┤\n\n│약식│수(繡)    │11×35  │청록적황│견직│                    │\n\n│长度├─────┼────┼────┼──┼──────────┤\n\n│ │符号图案 │10×18 │五色 │黄铜│ │\n\n├──┼─────┼────┼────┼──┼──────────┤\n\n│长度│连接方式│13×38 │金色 │黄铜│ │\n\n│    ├─────┼────┼────┼──┼──────────┤\n\n│    │수(繡)    │45×35  │청록적황│견직│                    │\n\n│    ├─────┼────┼────┼──┼──────────┤\n\n│ │戒指 │7×15 │金色 │黄铜│ │\n\n│    ├─────┼────┼────┼──┼──────────┤\n\n│ │连接环 │19×13 │金色 │黄铜│ │\n\n│    ├─────┼────┼────┼──┼──────────┤\n\n│ │大号镀金板│45×45 │金色 │黄铜│ │\n\n│    ├─────┼────┼────┼──┼──────────┤\n\n│ │小金盘│38×35 │金色 │黄铜│ │\n\n│    ├─────┼────┼────┼──┼──────────┤\n\n│ │符号图案 │18×18 │五色 │黄铜│ │\n\n│    ├─────┼────┼────┼──┼──────────┤\n\n│    │두께      │3.5     │        │    │2단                 │\n\n└──┴─────┴────┴────┴──┴──────────┘\n\n平昌冬奥会和冬残奥会奖牌证书\n■ 平昌冬奥会和冬残奥会旗帜订购单 [附件表格]                     \n\n  ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓  \n\n  ┃                                                                    ┃  \n\n  ┃编号┃  \n\n  ┃                                                                    ┃  \n\n  ┃平昌冬奥会和冬残奥会 ┃  \n\n"},{"id":"A38461-zh-00001","doc":"A38461","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812896","source_hash":"4183b6744939d23faadd402d776a2fea268f49ca44862b5d8dc79d734943d51f","text":"■ 平昌冬奥会和冬残奥会旗帜顺序 [星号]"},{"id":"A38461-zh-00002","doc":"A38461","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812897","source_hash":"5f5e7c645de564a1088ffccdeff467f933ccc4b5eb6d0e2a39316bb3ee4e4c23","text":"平昌冬奥会和冬残奥会会徽的形式和样式（与第3条相关）"},{"id":"A38461-zh-00003","doc":"A38461","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812898","source_hash":"893077dbaa0336fcea280132f8288d80b7e503089982b06b4feeffcb4c097a9b","text":"1. 长度类型"},{"id":"A38461-zh-00004","doc":"A38461","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812899","source_hash":"1dedb6b2e256b06964221a506cfa0d0c84780af4548c7de8406dc7f277024c4a","text":"2. 小米表单"},{"id":"A38461-zh-00005","doc":"A38461","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812902","source_hash":"3315ba0b108141e96858b9e2f28a4c4dd6b67d0d7c09304b64f9904be9c1d6bc","text":"尺寸(mm)"},{"id":"A38461-zh-00006","doc":"A38461","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812903","source_hash":"5a2fdefe4a62f26a27479303cfcf9dcfb27490a6c153d4eba11059bc15a3f683","text":"颜色"},{"id":"A38461-zh-00007","doc":"A38461","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812904","source_hash":"cff206505c96a240e3b08a43194d6010ca57773fe62ea19bd732c1dfb5700042","text":"材料"},{"id":"A38461-zh-00008","doc":"A38461","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812905","source_hash":"cb8c6b238f800814355e19339cd8accac66e3694f0770d65b3b95a72a190e49c","text":"备注"},{"id":"A38461-zh-00009","doc":"A38461","law_id":"kr-013511-209587-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812906"